    "originating_source": "Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation, National Rates and Rate Caps (SAVNRNJ, MMNRNJ); Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis from Board of Governors H.6, FDIC national rates and iMoneyNet money-fund rates (M2OWN)",
