    "license_notes": "FRED API Terms of Use (https://fred.stlouisfed.org/docs/api/terms_of_use.html). SAVNRNJ and MMNRNJ are FDIC compilations of rates gathered by RateWatch; M2OWN is a St. Louis Fed construction whose money-fund rate input comes from iMoneyNet (Informa Financial Intelligence), a commercial source. Internal use; cite FRED and the originating agency, and do not redistribute the third-party inputs."
